            <div xml:id="d172">

                <pb facs="0166" n="152" xml:id="pg152"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">810.20 Defense/2581: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Lane</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-05-20T20:00:00-04:00">May 20, 1942—8
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>591. The War Department and this Department are satisfied with the procedure
                    suggested in your 666 of May 18, 5 p.m. When you have seen President Santos it
                    is suggested that you inform General Andrews as well as the Department of the
                    substance of the understanding you may reach.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
